Error [E2932]: layout constraint mixes a horizontal and vertical value (`HVar` and `VVar`)
  --> tests/ui/layout_axis_mismatch.jet:6:15
    |
  6 |         label.left >= label.height + 8.0
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `left`/`right`/`width` are horizontal (`HVar`); `top`/`bottom`/`height` are vertical (`VVar`) — combining or comparing across axes is caught at compile time instead of producing a nonsensical layout
 Fix: compare or combine values from the same axis (a `LengthVar`, or a plain number, fits either axis)
